"Older daily totals used your Mac's timezone without saving its name. Choose the timezone used when those totals were recorded so recovery keeps the correct dates and avoids counting usage twice. Individual message records don't need this." = "较早的每日汇总按当时 Mac 的时区保存，但未记录时区名称。请选择记录这些汇总时所用的时区，以保留正确的日期并避免重复计数。单条消息记录不需要填写时区。";
"Not specified" = "未指定";
"Some old daily totals need their original timezone. Choose where they were recorded, then scan again." = "部分较早的每日记录需要原始时区。请选择记录时所在的时区，然后重新扫描。";
"Only needed for old daily totals. Leave unspecified if you don't know where they were recorded." = "仅较早的每日记录需要填写。如果不清楚记录时所在的时区，请保持未指定。";
"Older backups (optional)" = "较早的备份（可选）";
"Add an extracted Claude projects folder or an old CodexIsland preferences file." = "添加已解压的 Claude projects 文件夹，或较早的 CodexIsland 偏好设置文件。";
"Add projects folder…" = "添加 projects 文件夹…";
"Add preferences file…" = "添加偏好设置文件…";
"Remove %@" = "移除 %@";
"Choose old CodexIsland preferences" = "选择较早的 CodexIsland 偏好设置";
"Choose a Claude projects folder" = "选择 Claude projects 文件夹";
"Choose a valid timezone, then scan again." = "请选择有效的时区，然后重新扫描。";
"Could not read or save usage history. Check file access and available disk space, then scan again." = "无法读取或保存用量历史。请检查文件访问权限和可用磁盘空间，然后重新扫描。";
"The usage archive changed. Scan again before saving." = "用量存档已更改。请重新扫描后再保存。";
"A selected recovery source is no longer available. Choose it again, then scan." = "所选恢复来源已不可用。请重新选择后再扫描。";
"Saved token counts exceed the supported range. Check the recovery files before trying again." = "保存的 token 数量超出了支持范围。请检查恢复文件后重试。";
